OL,3,GNEWSASpecial delivery plane service
OL,4,Adropped after trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Post plans to scrap its
OL,7,Fspecial delivery plane service after a
OL,8,Fthree month trial showed it had
OL,9,F"limited demand".
OL,11,FA trial of the Special Delivery by Air
OL,12,Fservice was introduced in July
OL,13,Ffollowing the withdrawal of the
OL,14,Fdedicated mail plane, to offer
OL,15,Fcustomers a guaranteed next day
OL,16,Fdelivery option to the UK.
OL,18,FGuernsey Post said only 5% of its
OL,19,Fcustomers chose to use the service with
OL,20,Fmost people opting for its newly
OL,21,Fintroduced sea-based special delivery
OL,22,Fand tracked options.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
