OL,3,GNEWSASpecial delivery plane service
OL,4,Adropped after trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive Steve Sheridan said
OL,7,Fcustomer demand had "not been
OL,8,Fsufficient to justify continuing the
OL,9,Fair based service beyond the trial
OL,10,Fperiod." The service will run until 2
OL,11,FOctober.
